</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.4.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:153.6pt;--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.4.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Ambiguous intent; fragile orchestration; weak privacy, fairness, and compliance safeguards</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.4.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.4.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Limited</span><span id="S5.T2.4.2.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;"> (early prototypes)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.4.3" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F5F5F5;">
<td id="S5.T2.4.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:68.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F5F5F5;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.4.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Exploratory Data Analysis &amp; Visualization </span><span id="S5.T2.4.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">(S2)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.4.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F5F5F5;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.4.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Descriptive stats; chart generation; narrative reporting; multimodal reasoning; interactive analysis</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.4.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:153.6pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F5F5F5;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.4.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Faithfulness errors; scaling issues; domain misinterpretation; hallucinations; limited bias/safety checks</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.4.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F5F5F5;">
<span id="S5.T2.4.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.4.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;">Well covered</span><span id="S5.T2.4.3.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;"> (most agents)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.4.4" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFFFFF;">
<td id="S5.T2.4.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
